            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752710/extras/d761336c65b4b422ea20692b90a7128e.webp?t=1564766092\" width=600 height=60 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinity Trip</strong></h2> <br><strong>Its a physics-based titles, you control the ship by varying its altitude so that it can slip through the gaps.</strong><br><br>Infinity Trip is a simple and addictive endless runner game. In this game the player controls a little ship gliding through a beautiful exotic world, avoiding obstacles and collecting coins to unlock new spaceships. With a calm and zen-like background music, this is a perfect relaxing game for the players!<br><br><strong>Instructions:</strong><br>- Press the left mouse bouton to control your ship<br>- Avoid the Obstacles<br>- Collect coins to unlock new spaceships<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752710/extras/a251639e826d24f5c181659c0b5d1069.avif?t=1564766092\" width=600 height=330 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES :</strong></h2><br><strong>*Steam Leaderboard</strong><br><br><strong>*Steam Achievements</strong><br><br><strong>*Unlock new spaceships</strong><br><br>*Zen-like background music<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Come back to try to beat your highscore, and buy new spaceship with all the points you've collected!</strong></h2>",
